{{headline.en}}

Hello {{firstName}},

You haven't been active on the MINTvernetzt Community Platform for a while.
Maybe you have a lot going on right now. Many STEM actors can relate.

If you want to get back into it: In the community, you can find contacts, get inspired, and discover support for your
work.

Find suitable contacts
Search for actors and organizations – for example, by topics, skills, or locations. This way, you can find people to
exchange ideas and network with.

Discover events
Find events from the STEM community or create your own events and make them visible.

Discover projects and showcase your work
Get inspired by projects from other STEM actors and share your own experiences and ideas.

Find funding opportunities
The MINTvernetzt funding search consolidates funding programs from various funding databases and makes it easier for you
to research.

Make public relations easier
Use free images and graphics from the MINTvernetzt media database or create your own graphics for your public relations
work with the MINTvernetzt sharepic generator.

Our tip for getting back into it:
Take a quick look at your profile and check if your information is still up to date. This way, others can continue to
see what you are doing, what you are looking for, and where you might collaborate.

We look forward to seeing you again.

{{button.text.en}}: {{button.url}}

Best regards,
Your MINTvernetzt team